# What the docker build is allowed to see.
#
# The build context has to be the whole repository, because `COPY` can only name paths inside the
# context and the image is built from the shared pins and the conda environment. Everything is
# therefore excluded and the few things the build needs are named, so that anything added to the
# repository later stays out of the context until it is asked for.

*

!requirements.txt
!Project.toml
!Manifest.toml
!conda/
